{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"hideTabBar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A view that hides the tab bar and propagates the hidden state to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTabBar"},{"text":" overlay items.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this modifier instead of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".toolbar(.hidden, for: .tabBar)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whenever a view inside a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"text":" embedded in an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTabBar"},{"text":" needs to hide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the tab bar. Without this modifier, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTabBar"},{"text":" cannot detect the visibility change","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and its overlay elements remain visible on top of the content. This helper must be used for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"apps with nested views and tab bars.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Otherwise for simple app ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".toolbar(.hidden, for: .tabBar)"},{"text":" is enough.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":